| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `props` | Added `params` prop (default `{}`) so app/dockview panels can seed an initial view |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `computed.requestedView` | New computed resolving the requested view from `params.view`, `params.params.view`, or `$route.query.view` |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `created` | Sets `activeView` from requested view; only shows board list when on board view with no active board |
| `src/components/kanban/board/KanbanBoardView.vue` | Modify | `watch` | Added `requestedView` watcher (applies view on param/route change) and `activeView` watcher (board-list fallback) |
